  "bodyText": "Driving innovation in Financial Services.\n\nFaced with greater complexity than ever, financial services providers rely on data, digital, and Al to stay ahead of the competition and ensure resilience.\n\nGet in touch\nWe help financial services organisations take control of data, manage risk and compliance, deliver transformation, and adopt AI at scale.\nTackling change and complexity in Financial Services.\nRegulatory landscape.\n\nAs new regulations (like the EU's DORA) and mandatory digital interfaces come into force and supply chains grow more complex, compliance is crucial and automated data governance is more relevant than ever.\n\nComplexity and risk.\nCustomer outcomes.\nDigital transformation.\nData intelligence.\nOperationalising Al.\n\n\"With Aimi, I've added three key areas of business value: compliance, cost, and efficiencies.\"\n\nAdam Stancliffe, Head of Data Governance\n\n\"It was great to be part of an energetic session exploring how we could use Gen Al and Predictive Al models to support our clients' growth ambitions and to remove/reduce non-value-add activities for our Relationship Teams.\"\n\nClaire May, Head of Data & Digital for Corporate & Commercial Banking\n\nTech-enabled transformation in Financial Services.\nView all Case Studies\nFCA selects the Aimi Insight Engine to deliver enterprise search and discovery.\nView Case Study\nSimplifying data governance and migration for one of the UK's largest pension providers.\nView Case Study\nExplore Aiimi solutions.\nAI Data Governance\nAI Workplace Search\nLegacy System Migration\nAI Strategy & Roadmap\nData Strategy\nDigital Products\nTalk to us to get started.\n\nWe're here to help, whether you need a quick question answered or a deeper conversation with one of our experts. Just fill in the form and we'll be in touch within one working day.\n\nFirst Name*\nLast Name*\nEmail*\nPhone\nMessage\nHow did you first hear about us?\nPlease select\nSearch engine (e.g. Google, Bing)\nSocial media\nAI (ChatGPT, Copilot, Claude, etc)\nEvent or Webinar\nOnline advertisement\nNews or media article\nPodcast\nOfficial Aiimi Partner\nReview site (e.g. Gartner, G2)\nReferred by an Aiimi customer\nWord of mouth\nColleague or employer\nOther\nFrom time to time, we would like to contact you about our products, services, events and other content that we think will be of interest to you. You can unsubscribe from these communications at any time.\nYes please - I’d like to hear more from Aiimi!\nBy submitting this form you consent to us processing and storing the information you provide in accordance with our Privacy Policy\nSUBMIT"
